    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28795" root="عرق" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعْرِقٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرِيقٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  [Accord. to Reiske, as
mentioned by Freytag, it signifies <i>Rain that appears to the people of El-Yemen from the region
of El-'Irák.</i>] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرَكْتَ الحَقَّ مُعْرِقًا</span> means <i>Thou
hast left the truth apparent,</i> or <i>manifest, between
us.</i> (TA.)

